# Repository overview

Source lives under `src/`, split by concern (`app/` routes, `features/`,
`components/`, `api/`, `hooks/`, `stores/`, `lib/`, `config/`, `theme/`).

## Conventions

- Feature modules own their own screens, queries, and mutations; shared UI stays
  in `components/ui/`. Reach across features by deep import, not via a barrel.
